You are an AI coding assistant working on SpacetimeTV.

## Stack
FastAPI (Python 3.12) + React 19 + Vite 8 + Tailwind + nginx + ffmpeg

## Build & Test
- Build: `cd web && npm run build`
- Test: `cd web && npm test && cd ../server && python -m pytest tests/ --ignore=tests/test_live.py`
- Lint: check for warnings before committing

## Conventions
- No API keys in code — all via .env in server/.env
- IPTV calls use curl_cffi (not httpx)
- Rate limits: /api/live/all 2 req/min, /api/search 30 req/min

## Ports
- 8720 FastAPI backend
- 5183 Vite dev server
- 8722 nginx production

## Documentation
- AGENTS.md — full agent onboarding
- CLAUDE.md — Claude Code quickstart
- Makefile — build/test/lint targets (`make help`)
